{"id":"conv_05189","context":"A retired exec mentors a younger boss about corporate culture","ambient":"cafe_quiet_chatter","cast":["hiroshi_elder","hiroshi_boss"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"When I was young, I was constantly chasing payment confirmations as accounting section chief.","jp":"若い頃、私も経理室長として、毎日入金確認に追われていたよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,4,8,11,18,38,49,58,68,411,491,622,1055,5987,6086,6298,7606,7885,9576,9675],"jpTokens":[{"s":"若い","r":"わかい","w":1055},{"s":"頃","r":"ころ","w":411},{"s":"、"},{"s":"私","r":"わたし","w":38},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"経理","r":"けいり","w":6086},{"s":"室長","r":"しつちょう","w":9675},{"s":"として","w":49},{"s":"、"},{"s":"毎日","r":"まいにち","w":622},{"s":"入金","r":"にゅうきん","w":9576},{"s":"確認","r":"かくにん","w":491},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"追わ","r":"おわ","w":7606},{"s":"れ","w":58},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"い","w":18},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_boss","mood":null,"en":"I see. Actually, early next month I've been tasked with overhauling the return policy, and honestly, my head hurts.","jp":"そうでしたか。実は来月上旬、返品ポリシーの全面見直しを任されまして、正直、頭が痛いんです。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,4,5,6,8,14,16,17,26,28,58,61,117,432,487,1578,2394,2807,3407,3550,4781,4964,6312,7202,9566,9637,10689,14260,17752,18892],"jpTokens":[{"s":"そう","w":61},{"s":"でし","w":17},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"。"},{"s":"実は","r":"じつは","w":487},{"s":"来月","r":"らいげつ","w":6312},{"s":"上旬","r":"じょうじゅん","w":9566},{"s":"、"},{"s":"返品","r":"へんぴん","w":9637},{"s":"ポリシー","w":4964},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"全面","r":"ぜんめん","w":3407},{"s":"見直し","r":"みなおし","w":2394},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"任さ","r":"まかさ","w":14260},{"s":"れ","w":58},{"s":"まし","w":14},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"、"},{"s":"正直","r":"しょうじき","w":1578},{"s":"、"},{"s":"頭","r":"あたま","w":432},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"痛い","r":"いたい","w":2807},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Policies matter, but the real question is how you